\p 
\v 1 \w Then Jerubbaal| strong="H3378" \w*, who is \w Gideon| strong="H1439" \w*, \w and all the people| strong="H5971" \w* that were [with him, rose up early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and pitched]{strong=“H2583” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w beside the well of Harod| strong="H5878" \w*: \w so that the host| strong="H4264" \w* \w of the Midianites| strong="H4080" \w* \w were on the north side| strong="H6828" \w* [of them, by the hill]{strong=“H1389”} \w of Moreh| strong="H4176" \w*, \w in the valley| strong="H6010" \w*. 
