\v 9 [And he took]{strong=“H7287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thereof in his hands| strong="H3709" \w*, [and went on]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [eating]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and came]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w to his father| strong="H1" \w* \w and mother| strong="H517" \w*, [and he gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them, and they did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [but he told]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} [not them that he had taken]{strong=“H7287” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the honey| strong="H1706" \w* \w out of the carcase| strong="H1472" \w* \w of the lion| strong="H738" \w*. 
\p
