\c 16
\p 
\v 1 [Then went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Samson| strong="H8123" \w* \w to Gaza| strong="H5804" \w*, [and saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [there an harlot]{strong=“H2181 H802” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [and went in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto her.\f + \fr 16:1 \ft harlot: Heb. a woman an harlot \f* 
\v 2 And it was told \w the Gazites| strong="H5841" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w Samson| strong="H8123" \w* [is come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} hither. And they compassed him [in]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and laid wait]{strong=“H693” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for him all night| strong="H3915" \w* \w in the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*, [and were quiet]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} \w all the night| strong="H3915" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w In the morning| strong="H1242" \w*, \w when it is day| strong="H216" \w*, [we shall kill]{strong=“H2026” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} him.\f + \fr 16:2 \ft quiet: Heb. silence \f* 
\v 3 \w And Samson| strong="H8123" \w* [lay]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [till midnight]{strong=“H3915 H2677”}, [and arose]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [at midnight]{strong=“H3915 H2677”}, [and took]{strong=“H270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the doors| strong="H1817" \w* \w of the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*, \w and the two| strong="H8147" \w* \w posts| strong="H4201" \w*, [and went away]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [with them, bar]{strong=“H1280”} [and all, and put]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} them \w upon his shoulders| strong="H3802" \w*, [and carried them up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w to the top| strong="H7218" \w* \w of an hill| strong="H2022" \w* that is \w before| strong="H6440" \w* \w Hebron| strong="H2275" \w*.\f + \fr 16:3 \ft bar…: Heb. with the bar \f* 
\p
\v 4 \w And it came to pass afterward| strong="H310" \w*, [that he loved]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a woman| strong="H802" \w* \w in the valley| strong="H5158" \w* \w of Sorek| strong="H7796" \w*, \w whose name| strong="H8034" \w* was \w Delilah| strong="H1807" \w*.\f + \fr 16:4 \ft in…: or, by the brook \f* 
\v 5 \w And the lords| strong="H5633" \w* \w of the Philistines| strong="H6430" \w* [came up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, Entice]{strong=“H6601” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} [him, and see]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w wherein his great| strong="H1419" \w* \w strength| strong="H3581" \w* lieth, and by what means [we may prevail]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [against him, that we may bind]{strong=“H631” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [him to afflict]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} [him: and we will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee every one| strong="H376" \w* [of us eleven hundred]{strong=“H3967 H505”} pieces \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*.\f + \fr 16:5 \ft afflict: or, humble \f* 
\p
\v 6 \w And Delilah| strong="H1807" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Samson| strong="H8123" \w*, [Tell]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} [me, I pray thee, wherein thy great]{strong=“H1419”} \w strength| strong="H3581" \w* lieth, [and wherewith thou mightest be bound]{strong=“H631” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} [to afflict]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} thee. 
