\v 29 \w And Samson| strong="H8123" \w* [took hold]{strong=“H3943” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of the two| strong="H8147" \w* \w middle| strong="H8432" \w* \w pillars| strong="H5982" \w* \w upon which the house| strong="H1004" \w* [stood]{strong=“H3559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”}, [and on which it was borne up]{strong=“H5564” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, \w of the one| strong="H259" \w* \w with his right hand| strong="H3225" \w*, \w and of the other| strong="H259" \w* \w with his left| strong="H8040" \w*.\f + \fr 16:29 \ft on which…: or, he leaned on them \f* 
\v 30 \w And Samson| strong="H8123" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Let me die]{strong=“H5315 H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with the Philistines| strong="H6430" \w*. [And he bowed]{strong=“H5186” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} himself with all his \w might| strong="H3581" \w*; \w and the house| strong="H1004" \w* [fell]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w upon the lords| strong="H5633" \w*, \w and upon all the people| strong="H5971" \w* that were [therein. So the dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} [which he slew]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w at his death| strong="H4194" \w* \w were more| strong="H7227" \w* than they [which he slew]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w in his life| strong="H2416" \w*.\f + \fr 16:30 \ft me: Heb. my soul \f* 
\v 31 \w Then his brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w and all the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of his father| strong="H1" \w* [came down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and took]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him, and brought him [up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and buried]{strong=“H6912” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w him between Zorah| strong="H6881" \w* \w and Eshtaol| strong="H847" \w* \w in the buryingplace| strong="H6913" \w* \w of Manoah| strong="H4495" \w* \w his father| strong="H1" \w*. [And he judged]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w twenty| strong="H6242" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w*.
\c 17
\p 
\v 1 \w And there was a man| strong="H376" \w* \w of mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w whose name| strong="H8034" \w* was \w Micah| strong="H4321" \w*. 
\v 2 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto his mother| strong="H517" \w*, [The eleven hundred]{strong=“H3967 H505”} shekels \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w* [that were taken]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} [from thee, about which thou cursedst]{strong=“H422” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and spakest]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w of also in mine ears| strong="H241" \w*, [behold, the silver]{strong=“H3701”} is [with me; I took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [it. And his mother]{strong=“H517”} [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Blessed]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} be thou of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w my son| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 3 [And when he had restored]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [the eleven hundred]{strong=“H3967 H505”} shekels \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w* \w to his mother| strong="H517" \w*, \w his mother| strong="H517" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I had wholly]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [dedicated]{strong=“H6942” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the silver| strong="H3701" \w* unto the \sc Lord\sc* \w from my hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w for my son| strong="H1121" \w*, [to make]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w a graven image| strong="H6459" \w* \w and a molten image| strong="H4541" \w*: [now therefore I will restore]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} it unto thee. 
\v 4 [Yet he restored]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the money| strong="H3701" \w* \w unto his mother| strong="H517" \w*; \w and his mother| strong="H517" \w* [took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w two hundred| strong="H3967" \w* shekels \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w*, [and gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [them to the founder]{strong=“H6884” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [who made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thereof a graven image| strong="H6459" \w* \w and a molten image| strong="H4541" \w*: \w and they were in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4321" \w*. 
\v 5 \w And the man| strong="H376" \w* \w Micah| strong="H4318" \w* \w had an house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of gods| strong="H430" \w*, [and made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w an ephod| strong="H646" \w*, \w and teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*, [and consecrated]{strong=“H3027 H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w one| strong="H259" \w* \w of his sons| strong="H1121" \w*, \w who became his priest| strong="H3548" \w*.\f + \fr 17:5 \ft consecrated: Heb. filled the hand \f* 
\v 6 \w In those days| strong="H3117" \w* there was \w no king| strong="H4428" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, but \w every man| strong="H376" \w* [did]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} that which was \w right| strong="H3477" \w* \w in his own eyes| strong="H5869" \w*. 
\p
\v 7 \w And there was a young man| strong="H5288" \w* [out of Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”} \w of the family| strong="H4940" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, who was \w a Levite| strong="H3881" \w*, [and he sojourned]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} there. 
\v 8 \w And the man| strong="H376" \w* [departed]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w out of the city| strong="H5892" \w* [from Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”} [to sojourn]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [where he could find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} a place: [and he came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w* \w to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [as he journeyed]{strong=“H1870 H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}.\f + \fr 17:8 \ft as he…: Heb. in making his way \f* 
\v 9 \w And Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Whence]{strong=“H370”} [comest]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thou? And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto him, I am \w a Levite| strong="H3881" \w* [of Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”}, [and I go]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to sojourn]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [where I may find]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} a place. 
\v 10 \w And Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [with me, and be unto me a father]{strong=“H1”} \w and a priest| strong="H3548" \w*, [and I will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee ten| strong="H6235" \w* shekels \w of silver| strong="H3701" \w* \w by the year| strong="H3117" \w*, \w and a suit| strong="H6187" \w* \w of apparel| strong="H899" \w*, \w and thy victuals| strong="H4241" \w*. \w So the Levite| strong="H3881" \w* [went in]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 17:10 \ft a suit…: or, a double suit, etc: Heb. an order of garments \f* 
\v 11 \w And the Levite| strong="H3881" \w* [was content]{strong=“H2974” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [to dwell]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w with the man| strong="H376" \w*; \w and the young man| strong="H5288" \w* \w was unto him as one| strong="H259" \w* \w of his sons| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 12 \w And Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [consecrated ]{strong=“H3027 H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the Levite| strong="H3881" \w*; \w and the young man| strong="H5288" \w* \w became his priest| strong="H3548" \w*, \w and was in the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*. 
\v 13 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [Now know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} I that the \sc Lord\sc* [will do me good]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, \w seeing I have a Levite| strong="H3881" \w* to my \w priest| strong="H3548" \w*.
\c 18
\p 
\v 1 \w In those days| strong="H3117" \w* there was \w no king| strong="H4428" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: \w and in those days| strong="H3117" \w* \w the tribe| strong="H7626" \w* \w of the Danites| strong="H1839" \w* [sought]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w them an inheritance| strong="H5159" \w* [to dwell in]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}; \w for unto that day| strong="H3117" \w* all their \w inheritance| strong="H5159" \w* [had not fallen]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto them among| strong="H8432" \w* \w the tribes| strong="H7626" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\v 2 \w And the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w* [sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w of their family| strong="H4940" \w* \w five| strong="H2568" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* \w from their coasts| strong="H7098" \w*, \w men| strong="H1121" \w* \w of valour| strong="H2428" \w*, \w from Zorah| strong="H6881" \w*, \w and from Eshtaol| strong="H847" \w*, [to spy]{strong=“H7270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w out the land| strong="H776" \w*, [and to search]{strong=“H2713” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [it; and they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [search]{strong=“H2713” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the land| strong="H776" \w*: [who when they came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, \w to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [they lodged]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} there.\f + \fr 18:2 \ft men of: Heb. sons of \f* 
\v 3 When they were \w by the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [they knew]{strong=“H5234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w the voice| strong="H6963" \w* \w of the young man| strong="H5288" \w* \w the Levite| strong="H3881" \w*: [and they turned in]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thither, and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Who brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w thee hither| strong="H1988" \w*? [and what makest]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} thou in this place? and what hast thou here? 
\v 4 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, Thus]{strong=“H2090”} \w and thus| strong="H2090" \w* [dealeth]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [with me, and hath hired]{strong=“H7936” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [me, and I am his priest]{strong=“H3548”}. 
\v 5 [And they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Ask counsel]{strong=“H7592” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [we pray thee, of God]{strong=“H430”}, [that we may know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w whether our way| strong="H1870" \w* [which we go]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [shall be prosperous]{strong=“H6743” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}. 
\v 6 \w And the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, Go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w in peace| strong="H7965" \w*: \w before| strong="H5227" \w* the \sc Lord\sc* is \w your way| strong="H1870" \w* [wherein ye go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\p
\v 7 \w Then the five| strong="H2568" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* [departed]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Laish| strong="H3919" \w*, [and saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the people| strong="H5971" \w* that were \w therein| strong="H7130" \w*, [how they dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w careless| strong="H983" \w*, \w after the manner| strong="H4941" \w* \w of the Zidonians| strong="H6722" \w*, [quiet]{strong=“H8252” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [and secure]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}; and there was [no magistrate]{strong=“H6114 H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w in the land| strong="H776" \w*, that might put them [to shame]{strong=“H3637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} in any \w thing| strong="H1697" \w*; and they were \w far| strong="H7350" \w* \w from the Zidonians| strong="H6722" \w*, \w and had no business| strong="H1697" \w* with any \w man| strong="H120" \w*.\f + \fr 18:7 \ft Laish: also called, Leshem \f* \f + \fr 18:7 \ft magistrate: Heb. possessor, or, heir of restraints \f* 
\v 8 [And they came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto their brethren| strong="H251" \w* \w to Zorah| strong="H6881" \w* \w and Eshtaol| strong="H847" \w*: \w and their brethren| strong="H251" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto them, What say ye? 
\v 9 [And they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Arise]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [that we may go up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [against them: for we have seen]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the land| strong="H776" \w*, and, behold, it is \w very| strong="H3966" \w* \w good| strong="H2896" \w*: and are [ye still]{strong=“H2814” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}? [be not slothful]{strong=“H6101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} [to go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, and [to enter]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [to possess]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the land| strong="H776" \w*. 
\v 10 [When ye go]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [ye shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto a people| strong="H5971" \w* [secure]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w and to a large| strong="H7342" \w* \w land| strong="H776" \w*: \w for God| strong="H430" \w* [hath given]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w it into your hands| strong="H3027" \w*; \w a place| strong="H4725" \w* where there is \w no want| strong="H4270" \w* \w of any thing| strong="H1697" \w* that is \w in the earth| strong="H776" \w*. 
\p
\v 11 [And there went]{strong=“H5265” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from thence of the family| strong="H4940" \w* \w of the Danites| strong="H1839" \w*, \w out of Zorah| strong="H6881" \w* \w and out of Eshtaol| strong="H847" \w*, \w six| strong="H8337" \w* \w hundred| strong="H3967" \w* \w men| strong="H376" \w* [appointed]{strong=“H2296” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with weapons| strong="H3627" \w* \w of war| strong="H4421" \w*.\f + \fr 18:11 \ft appointed: Heb. girded \f* 
\v 12 [And they went up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and pitched]{strong=“H2583” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [in Kirjath-jearim]{strong=“H7157”}, \w in Judah| strong="H3063" \w*: [wherefore they called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that place| strong="H4725" \w* [Mahaneh-dan]{strong=“H4265”} \w unto this day| strong="H3117" \w*: behold, it is \w behind| strong="H310" \w* [Kirjath-jearim]{strong=“H7157”}. 
\v 13 [And they passed]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thence unto mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [and came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*. 
\p
\v 14 [Then answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the five| strong="H2568" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* [that went]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to spy out]{strong=“H7270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w the country| strong="H776" \w* \w of Laish| strong="H3919" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto their brethren| strong="H251" \w*, [Do ye know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w that there is| strong="H3426" \w* \w in these houses| strong="H1004" \w* \w an ephod| strong="H646" \w*, \w and teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*, \w and a graven image| strong="H6459" \w*, \w and a molten image| strong="H4541" \w*? [now therefore consider]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [what ye have to do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 15 [And they turned]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thitherward, and came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of the young man| strong="H5288" \w* \w the Levite| strong="H3881" \w*, even \w unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [and saluted]{strong=“H7965 H7592” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him.\f + \fr 18:15 \ft saluted…: Heb. asked him of peace \f* 
\v 16 \w And the six| strong="H8337" \w* \w hundred| strong="H3967" \w* \w men| strong="H376" \w* [appointed]{strong=“H2296” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with their weapons| strong="H3627" \w* \w of war| strong="H4421" \w*, which were \w of the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w*, [stood]{strong=“H5324” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w by the entering| strong="H6607" \w* \w of the gate| strong="H8179" \w*. 
\v 17 \w And the five| strong="H2568" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* [that went]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [to spy out]{strong=“H7270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w the land| strong="H776" \w* [went up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, and [came in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thither, and [took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the graven image| strong="H6459" \w*, \w and the ephod| strong="H646" \w*, \w and the teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*, \w and the molten image| strong="H4541" \w*: \w and the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [stood]{strong=“H5324” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w in the entering| strong="H6607" \w* \w of the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w with the six| strong="H8337" \w* \w hundred| strong="H3967" \w* \w men| strong="H376" \w* that were [appointed]{strong=“H2296” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w with weapons| strong="H3627" \w* \w of war| strong="H4421" \w*. 
\v 18 [And these went]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [into Micah’s]{strong=“H4318”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and fetched]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the carved image| strong="H6459" \w*, \w the ephod| strong="H646" \w*, \w and the teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*, \w and the molten image| strong="H4541" \w*. [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [unto them, What do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} ye? 
\v 19 [And they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Hold thy peace]{strong=“H2790” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, [lay]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thine hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w upon thy mouth| strong="H6310" \w*, [and go]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [with us, and be to us]{strong=“H1961” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w a father| strong="H1" \w* \w and a priest| strong="H3548" \w*: is it \w better| strong="H2896" \w* \w for thee to be a priest| strong="H3548" \w* \w unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of one| strong="H259" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w*, \w or that thou be a priest| strong="H3548" \w* \w unto a tribe| strong="H7626" \w* \w and a family| strong="H4940" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*? 
\v 20 [And the priest’s]{strong=“H3548”} \w heart| strong="H3820" \w* [was glad]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and he took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the ephod| strong="H646" \w*, \w and the teraphim| strong="H8655" \w*, \w and the graven image| strong="H6459" \w*, [and went in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the midst| strong="H7130" \w* \w of the people| strong="H5971" \w*. 
\v 21 [So they turned]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and departed]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and put]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the little ones| strong="H2945" \w* \w and the cattle| strong="H4735" \w* \w and the carriage| strong="H3520" \w* \w before| strong="H6440" \w* them. 
\p
\v 22 And [when they were a good way]{strong=“H7368” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w from the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, \w the men| strong="H582" \w* that were \w in the houses| strong="H1004" \w* [near to Micah’s]{strong=“H4318”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w* [were gathered together]{strong=“H2199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, [and overtook]{strong=“H1692” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w*. 
\v 23 [And they cried]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w*. [And they turned]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w their faces| strong="H6440" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Micah| strong="H4318" \w*, [What aileth thee, that thou comest with such a company]{strong=“H2199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}?\f + \fr 18:23 \ft comest…: Heb. art gathered together? \f* 
\v 24 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Ye have taken away]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w my gods| strong="H430" \w* [which I made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and the priest| strong="H3548" \w*, [and ye are gone away]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: and what have I more? and what is this that [ye say]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto me, What aileth thee? 
\v 25 \w And the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Let not thy voice]{strong=“H6963”} [be heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [among us, lest angry]{strong=“H5315 H4751”} \w fellows| strong="H582" \w* [run]{strong=“H6293” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [upon thee, and thou lose]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w thy life| strong="H5315" \w*, \w with the lives| strong="H5315" \w* \w of thy household| strong="H1004" \w*.\f + \fr 18:25 \ft angry: Heb. bitter of soul \f* 
\v 26 \w And the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w* [went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their way| strong="H1870" \w*: \w and when Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} that they were \w too strong| strong="H2389" \w* [for him, he turned]{strong=“H6437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and went back]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto his house| strong="H1004" \w*. 
\p
\v 27 [And they took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the things \w which Micah| strong="H4318" \w* [had made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and the priest| strong="H3548" \w* [which he had, and came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Laish| strong="H3919" \w*, \w unto a people| strong="H5971" \w* that were [at quiet]{strong=“H8252” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [and secure]{strong=“H982” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [and they smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w them with the edge| strong="H6310" \w* \w of the sword| strong="H2719" \w*, [and burnt]{strong=“H8313” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the city| strong="H5892" \w* \w with fire| strong="H784" \w*. 
\v 28 And there was [no deliverer]{strong=“H5337” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}, because it was \w far| strong="H7350" \w* \w from Zidon| strong="H6721" \w*, \w and they had no business| strong="H1697" \w* with any \w man| strong="H120" \w*; \w and it was in the valley| strong="H6010" \w* that lieth [by Beth-rehob]{strong=“H1050”}. [And they built]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a city| strong="H5892" \w*, [and dwelt]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} therein. 
\v 29 [And they called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the name| strong="H8034" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w* \w Dan| strong="H1835" \w*, \w after the name| strong="H8034" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w* \w their father| strong="H1" \w*, [who was born]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} \w unto Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: \w howbeit| strong="H199" \w* \w the name| strong="H8034" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w* was \w Laish| strong="H3919" \w* \w at the first| strong="H7223" \w*. 
\p
\v 30 \w And the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1835" \w* [set up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w the graven image| strong="H6459" \w*: \w and Jonathan| strong="H3083" \w*, \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Gershom| strong="H1647" \w*, \w the son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Manasseh| strong="H4519" \w*, \w he and his sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w were priests| strong="H3548" \w* \w to the tribe| strong="H7626" \w* \w of Dan| strong="H1839" \w* \w until the day| strong="H3117" \w* [of the captivity]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w of the land| strong="H776" \w*. 
\v 31 [And they set them up]{strong=“H7760” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [Micah’s]{strong=“H4318”} \w graven image| strong="H6459" \w*, [which he made]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w all the time| strong="H3117" \w* \w that the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w* \w was in Shiloh| strong="H7887" \w*. 
\c 19
\p 
\v 1 \w And it came to pass in those days| strong="H3117" \w*, when there was \w no king| strong="H4428" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, \w that there was a certain| strong="H376" \w* \w Levite| strong="H3881" \w* [sojourning]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w on the side| strong="H3411" \w* \w of mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*, [who took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to him a concubine]{strong=“H6370 H802”} [out of Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”}.\f + \fr 19:1 \ft a concubine: Heb. a woman a concubine, or, a wife a concubine \f* 
\v 2 \w And his concubine| strong="H6370" \w* [played the whore]{strong=“H2181” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [against him, and went away]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [from him unto her father’s]{strong=“H1”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w* [to Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”}, \w and was there four| strong="H702" \w* [whole months]{strong=“H3117 H2320”}.\f + \fr 19:2 \ft four whole months: or, a year and four month: Heb. days, four months \f* 
\v 3 \w And her husband| strong="H376" \w* [arose]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w after| strong="H310" \w* [her, to speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w friendly| strong="H3820" \w* unto her, and [to bring her again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”}, \w having his servant| strong="H5288" \w* [with him, and a couple]{strong=“H6776”} \w of asses| strong="H2543" \w*: [and she brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [him into her father’s]{strong=“H1”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w*: \w and when the father| strong="H1" \w* \w of the damsel| strong="H5291" \w* [saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him, he rejoiced]{strong=“H8055” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to meet]{strong=“H7125” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} him.\f + \fr 19:3 \ft friendly…: Heb. to her heart \f* 
\v 4 [And his father in law]{strong=“H2859” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [the damsel’s]{strong=“H5291”} \w father| strong="H1" \w*, [retained]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [him; and he abode]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with him three| strong="H7969" \w* \w days| strong="H3117" \w*: [so they did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and drink]{strong=“H8354” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and lodged]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} there. 
\p
\v 5 \w And it came to pass on the fourth| strong="H7243" \w* \w day| strong="H3117" \w*, [when they arose early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w in the morning| strong="H1242" \w*, [that he rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: [and the damsel’s]{strong=“H5291”} \w father| strong="H1" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto his son in law| strong="H2860" \w*, [Comfort]{strong=“H5582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thine heart| strong="H3820" \w* \w with a morsel| strong="H6595" \w* \w of bread| strong="H3899" \w*, \w and afterward| strong="H310" \w* [go your way]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 19:5 \ft Comfort: Heb. Strengthen \f* 
\v 6 [And they sat down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and drink]{strong=“H8354” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w both| strong="H8147" \w* \w of them together| strong="H3162" \w*: [for the damsel’s]{strong=“H5291”} \w father| strong="H1" \w* [had said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the man| strong="H376" \w*, [Be content]{strong=“H2974” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”}, [I pray thee, and tarry all night]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w and let thine heart| strong="H3820" \w* [be merry]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 7 \w And when the man| strong="H376" \w* [rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [his father in law]{strong=“H2859” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [urged]{strong=“H6484” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [him: therefore he lodged]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [there again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 8 [And he arose early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w in the morning| strong="H1242" \w* \w on the fifth| strong="H2549" \w* \w day| strong="H3117" \w* [to depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}: [and the damsel’s]{strong=“H5291”} \w father| strong="H1" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Comfort]{strong=“H5582” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thine heart| strong="H3824" \w*, [I pray thee. And they tarried]{strong=“H4102” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8701”} [until afternoon]{strong=“H5186 H3117” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [and they did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w both| strong="H8147" \w* of them.\f + \fr 19:8 \ft until afternoon: Heb. till the day declined \f* 
\v 9 \w And when the man| strong="H376" \w* [rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to depart]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [he, and his concubine]{strong=“H6370”}, \w and his servant| strong="H5288" \w*, [his father in law]{strong=“H2859” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [the damsel’s]{strong=“H5291”} \w father| strong="H1" \w*, [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Behold, now the day]{strong=“H3117”} [draweth]{strong=“H7503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [toward evening]{strong=“H6150” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [I pray you tarry all night]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}: [behold, the day]{strong=“H3117”} [groweth to an end]{strong=“H2583” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [lodge]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [here, that thine heart]{strong=“H3824”} [may be merry]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w and to morrow| strong="H4279" \w* [get you early]{strong=“H7925” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w on your way| strong="H1870" \w*, [that thou mayest go]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w home| strong="H168" \w*.\f + \fr 19:9 \ft draweth: Heb. is weak \f* \f + \fr 19:9 \ft the day groweth to an end: Heb. it is the pitching time of the day \f* \f + \fr 19:9 \ft home: Heb. to thy tent \f* 
\v 10 \w But the man| strong="H376" \w* [would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not tarry that night]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [but he rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and departed]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w over against| strong="H5227" \w* \w Jebus| strong="H2982" \w*, which is \w Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*; and there were \w with him two| strong="H6776" \w* \w asses| strong="H2543" \w* [saddled]{strong=“H2280” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”}, \w his concubine| strong="H6370" \w* also was with him.\f + \fr 19:10 \ft over against: Heb. to over against \f* 
\v 11 And when they were \w by Jebus| strong="H2982" \w*, \w the day| strong="H3117" \w* \w was far| strong="H3966" \w* [spent]{strong=“H7286” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w and the servant| strong="H5288" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto his master| strong="H113" \w*, [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [I pray thee, and let us turn in]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into this city| strong="H5892" \w* \w of the Jebusites| strong="H2983" \w*, [and lodge]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} in it. 
\v 12 \w And his master| strong="H113" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, We will not turn aside]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w hither into the city| strong="H5892" \w* \w of a stranger| strong="H5237" \w*, that is \w not of the children| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*; [we will pass over]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*. 
\v 13 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto his servant| strong="H5288" \w*, [Come]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and let us draw near]{strong=“H7126” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to one| strong="H259" \w* \w of these places| strong="H4725" \w* [to lodge all night]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w in Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*, \w or in Ramah| strong="H7414" \w*. 
\v 14 [And they passed on]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and went their way]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w and the sun| strong="H8121" \w* [went down]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} upon them when they were \w by| strong="H681" \w* \w Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*, which belongeth \w to Benjamin| strong="H1144" \w*. 
\v 15 [And they turned aside]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thither, to go in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} and [to lodge]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w in Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*: [and when he went in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [he sat him down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w in a street| strong="H7339" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*: for there was \w no man| strong="H376" \w* [that took]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w them into his house| strong="H1004" \w* [to lodging]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}. 
\p
\v 16 [And, behold, there came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w an old| strong="H2205" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w* \w from his work| strong="H4639" \w* \w out of the field| strong="H7704" \w* \w at even| strong="H6153" \w*, which was \w also| strong="H376" \w* \w of mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*; [and he sojourned]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w in Gibeah| strong="H1390" \w*: \w but the men| strong="H582" \w* \w of the place| strong="H4725" \w* were \w Benjamites| strong="H1145" \w*. 
\v 17 [And when he had lifted up]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his eyes| strong="H5869" \w*, [he saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [a wayfaring]{strong=“H732” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w man| strong="H376" \w* \w in the street| strong="H7339" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*: \w and the old| strong="H2205" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Whither goest]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thou? and whence]{strong=“H370”} [comest]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} thou? 
\v 18 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto him, We are [passing]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [from Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”} \w toward the side| strong="H3411" \w* \w of mount| strong="H2022" \w* \w Ephraim| strong="H669" \w*; from thence am [I: and I went]{strong=“H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to Beth-lehem-judah]{strong=“H3063 H1035”}, but I am now [going]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w to the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*; and there is \w no man| strong="H376" \w* [that receiveth]{strong=“H622” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w me to house| strong="H1004" \w*.\f + \fr 19:18 \ft receiveth: Heb. gathereth \f* 
\v 19 \w Yet there is| strong="H3426" \w* \w both straw| strong="H8401" \w* \w and provender| strong="H4554" \w* \w for our asses| strong="H2543" \w*; \w and there is bread| strong="H3899" \w* \w and wine| strong="H3196" \w* [also for me, and for thy handmaid]{strong=“H519”}, \w and for the young man| strong="H5288" \w* which is \w with thy servants| strong="H5650" \w*: there is \w no want| strong="H4270" \w* \w of any thing| strong="H1697" \w*. 
\v 20 \w And the old| strong="H2205" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Peace| strong="H7965" \w* be [with thee; howsoever]{strong=“H7535”} let \w all thy wants| strong="H4270" \w* lie [upon me; only lodge]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not in the street| strong="H7339" \w*. 
\v 21 [So he brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w him into his house| strong="H1004" \w*, [and gave provender]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the asses| strong="H2543" \w*: [and they washed]{strong=“H7364” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their feet| strong="H7272" \w*, [and did eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and drink]{strong=“H8354” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\p
\v 22 Now \w as they were making their hearts| strong="H3820" \w* [merry]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”}, [behold, the men]{strong=“H582”} \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*, \w certain| strong="H582" \w* \w sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Belial| strong="H1100" \w*, \w beset| strong="H5437" \w* \w the house| strong="H1004" \w* [round about]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”}, and [beat]{strong=“H1849” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8693”} \w at the door| strong="H1817" \w*, [and spake]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the master| strong="H1167" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w*, \w the old| strong="H2205" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Bring forth]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w the man| strong="H376" \w* [that came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into thine house| strong="H1004" \w*, [that we may know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} him. 
\v 23 \w And the man| strong="H376" \w*, \w the master| strong="H1167" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w*, [went out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto them, Nay]{strong=“H408”}, \w my brethren| strong="H251" \w*, nay, I pray you, do not so [wickedly]{strong=“H7489” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}; \w seeing| strong="H310" \w* \w that this man| strong="H376" \w* [is come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into mine house| strong="H1004" \w*, [do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not this folly| strong="H5039" \w*. 
\v 24 Behold, here is \w my daughter| strong="H1323" \w* \w a maiden| strong="H1330" \w*, \w and his concubine| strong="H6370" \w*; [them I will bring out]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [now, and humble]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} [ye them, and do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w with them what seemeth| strong="H5869" \w* \w good| strong="H2896" \w* [unto you: but unto this man]{strong=“H376”} [do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not so| strong="H2063" \w* \w vile| strong="H5039" \w* \w a thing| strong="H1697" \w*.\f + \fr 19:24 \ft so vile…: Heb. the matter of this folly \f* 
\v 25 \w But the men| strong="H582" \w* [would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not hearken]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [to him: so the man]{strong=“H376”} [took]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w his concubine| strong="H6370" \w*, [and brought]{strong=“H3318” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w her forth| strong="H2351" \w* [unto them; and they knew]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [her, and abused]{strong=“H5953” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”} \w her all the night| strong="H3915" \w* \w until the morning| strong="H1242" \w*: \w and when the day| strong="H7837" \w* [began to spring]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [they let her go]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}. 
